{"seq":2,"slug":"work-philosophy","title":"工作哲学","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/work-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"extreme-work-ethic","title":"极端的工作伦理","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/work-philosophy/extreme-work-ethic","wordCount":1415,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-and-ambition","title":"冒险与雄心","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/work-philosophy/risk-and-ambition","wordCount":1458,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 工作哲学\n\n马斯克能同时驱动多项宏大事业，离不开他独特而极端的工作哲学。本章考察其中两个核心面向。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"极端的工作伦理\"——他每周上百小时、亲力亲为、高压驱动的作风及其代价。第二篇文档讲述\"冒险与雄心\"，剖析他超乎常人的风险承受力与近乎狂妄的宏大雄心如何相辅相成。\n"}